@startuml
actor MANAGER
actor STAFF
participant "Web Admin / Mobile" as Client
participant "NestJS API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Socket.IO" as Socket

MANAGER -> Client : Tạo chuyến, gán xe/tài xế
Client -> API : POST /api/v1/trips
API -> DB : Tạo Trip PLANNED
DB --> API : Trip
API --> Client : 201 Trip
MANAGER -> Client : Thêm đơn vào manifest
Client -> API : POST /api/v1/trips/{tripId}/manifest/items
API -> DB : Kiểm tra đơn RECEIVED; thêm manifest item và chuyển WAITING_FOR_DISPATCH
DB --> API : ManifestItem + updated Order
API --> Client : 201 ManifestItem
STAFF -> Client : Quét xác nhận xếp kiện
Client -> API : PATCH /api/v1/manifest/items/{itemId}
API -> DB : Cập nhật item LOADED
DB --> API : Item LOADED
MANAGER -> Client : Điều phối xuất bến
Client -> API : PATCH /api/v1/trips/{tripId}/status
API -> DB : Transaction: Trip IN_TRANSIT + Order IN_TRANSIT + history
DB --> API : Updated trip/orders
API -> Socket : Emit order:status_changed + trip events
API --> Client : 200 Trip IN_TRANSIT
@enduml
